WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.555
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.555 --> 00:00:03.180
SPEAKER: Welcome to
the Click to Deploy

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.630
series, where we show you how
easy it is to deploy solutions

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.450
from Google Cloud Marketplace.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.130
Google Cloud
Marketplace has been

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.700
focused on helping
users explore, launch,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.250
and manage production-grade
solutions with just

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.570
a few clicks.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.690
Marketplace has an easy way
to deploy technical solutions

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.250
called Click to Deploy.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.890
Click to Deploy allows you
to deploy virtual machines

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.463
and Kubernetes solutions on
Google Compute Engine easily.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:32.130
You can deploy a
solution without having

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.770
to manually configure the
software, virtual machine

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.800
instance, storage,
or network settings.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.750
This helps you free
up more time to focus

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.700
on building great products.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.650
You have the option
to deploy solutions

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.470
like WordPress, LAMP stack,
MongoDB, and Apache Cassandra.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:52.560
With just the click of a button,
just search for the solution,

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:55.182
and select the ones that
meet your business needs.

00:00:55.182 --> 00:00:56.640
When you launch
the deployment, you

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.010
can either use the
default configurations

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.500
or customize the configurations
to meet your project needs.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.110
So next time you're
looking for a way

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.000
to quickly deploy your
solution, check out

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.830
Google Cloud Marketplace.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.270
To learn more, check out
cloud.google.com/marketplace.

